data: {"id": "2480551dbbd445ba-thinking-parallel_evidence-237", "run_id": "2480551dbbd445ba", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我已接收到首轮可观测性 baseline 数据。让我分析已有事实并执行其余的 Kubernetes 采集计划。\n\n**已有首轮 Baseline 事实摘要：**\n- **Metrics**: Pod Phase=Running (value=1), restarts=0, 无 waiting_reason。说明容器在运行，未重启。\n- **Logging**: 最近 30 分钟日志全部是 `\"dependency unavailable\"` HTTP 503 错误，路径 `/work`。\n- **Tracing**: DeepFlow 和 Tempo 确认了多笔 GET /work 请求返回 503，且 Tempo span 带有 `aiops.observed_mode=\"readiness_fail\"` 属性。这表明 `/work` 端点被标记为 readiness 检查失败。\n\n**关键缺口：**\n1. kubectl get/describe/yaml 尚未执行。\n2. kubectl logs (container logs) 尚未执行。\n3. query_pod_to", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789091447534, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

