data: {"id": "2480551dbbd445ba-thinking-parallel_evidence-1124", "run_id": "2480551dbbd445ba", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已确认实体身份与生命周期：\n\n- **Pod**: `workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` (UID: `705925d8-1e60-4c25-8300-62e280589dee`)\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-09`\n- **Node**: `node2`\n- **Owner**: ReplicaSet `workload-5f4fb9ff45` -> Deployment `workload`\n- **Service**: `aiops-lab-workload`\n- **Container**: `app`\n\n**当前状态结论 (NotReady)**:\n1.  **Pod Phase**: `Running`。Pod 已在 `node2` 上调度并运行了约 77 分钟。\n2.  **Ready Condition**: `False`。`kubectl get` 显示 `READY 0/1`。\n3.  **Container Status**: `app` 容器未就绪 (`ready=False`, `restarts=0`)。\n4", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789091498753, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

